WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:06.020
I can see it. The reconstruction
of this world is already underway.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:06.870
Wha?

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:09.860
A dark being utilized the
opportunity to infiltrate...

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.920
...while we were away at the battlefield.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.790
This place is an utterly different world!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.880
Either way, it's the same.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.730
No. It feels alien.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.100
Has the dark world already
eroded so far into this world?

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:26.500
I know what I must do.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.340
Schwartz Shield!

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.880
Togashi and Rikka, welcome back!

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.220
How was your field trip?

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.610
It had its ups and downs.

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:39.180
Wasn't it fun?

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.900
You two wandered around
the city together, right?

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:44.480
Hey, you got a new one!

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:48.360
The Schwartz Z/X Perfect
Customized Ghelzonianses!

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.040
Don't mix that in!

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.250
Ghelzoni?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:53.280
Good morning!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.630
Oh, if it isn't Ghelzonianses and my master!

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.380
I said, don't mix that in.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.030
Dekomori.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:05.290
Why are you acting so surprised, Master?

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.960
The dimension really has warped!

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:46.340
EPISODE VIII THE FALSE... MORI SUMMER
[OR "HOLY SPIRIT MOTHER"]

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:43.760
The real Mori Summer?!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.440
Ssh, not so loud.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:47.180
What do you mean?

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:51.560
There is no real thing. I'm right here.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.840
But she told me she met her.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:58.250
I think they became acquainted
through her home page

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.170
while you were away on your field trip.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:01.940
She's here.

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:06.760
H-how do you do?

00:03:06.760 --> 00:03:10.000
I have been expecting you,
Mistress Mori Summer.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.540
How do you do?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:15.020
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting, Sanja.

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.000
Did she say "Sanja"?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.900
But look at the gemstones on her left hand.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.970
Those are the Mori Summer trademark.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.310
I, the Magician Mori Summer,
have come here once again

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:28.180
to deliver my words of guidance unto you.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.450
Yes, ma'am. Thank you.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:35.290
I will begin with a purification
I and the soul spirits will perform.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.160
Please place your hands together
and close your eyes peacefully.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:38.960
Yes.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:52.960
I am done.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:54.680
What the heck was that?

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:56.850
I suspect that was a magical
purification device.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:57.770
What?!

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.710
That was obviously a digital camera.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.970
Who does that woman think she is anyway?

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:09.960
And so, you informed them of
my existence upon their return?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.950
Yes, ma'am. I intend to inform
Fake Mori Summer

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.150
of your existence as well,
Mistress Mori Summer.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.370
Then she'll be sorry!

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:22.990
Sanja, you mustn't approach others
with such evilness in your heart.

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:28.460
Yes, any commoner who would assume
the name of Mori Summer

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:32.500
is undoubtedly a thoroughly
twisted individual with an ugly heart.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.000
What?!

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:37.060
However, if you entertain
hatred for such a person...

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:40.030
that hate will only taint
your own purity, Sanja.

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.960
Love is most important!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:46.830
A foolish, worthless commoner
who thrives upon deceit...

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.940
is precisely who so desperately
needs our guidance!

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:50.880
Oh!

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.750
Oh, really? That woman is very interesting.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:56.910
Hey!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.860
It's you, Fake Sum...

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.950
I told you I'm not a fake.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.760
Oh, dear. Are you the one
who has been using my name?

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.160
Deko!

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:13.620
You're the identity thief!
How dare you make a home page?!

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:17.010
Oh, my. Sanja told me about you,

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:19.680
but I had no idea the pretense ran so deep.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.800
You must be extremely impure of heart.

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.630
It's easy to see.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:26.230
Oh, really?

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:27.190
Mistress Mori Summer!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:27.690
You stand back!

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:28.610
Deko!
You stand back!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:29.690
Sanja!

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:32.230
Who are you calling Sanja?! Now listen up!

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:35.570
I utterly despise women like you
who hide who they really are...

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:38.150
...behind a facade of goody-goodiness!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.870
Like you can talk.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.770
You butt out.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.360
Then are you suggesting that
you are the real Mori Summer?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:46.990
I am!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.240
If so, why do you hide who you really are?

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:54.660
I have been told that you attempted to burn
the scripture of the Mabinogion.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.180
Th-that was because...

00:05:56.180 --> 00:06:00.470
That's right! You would only do that
because you are the imposter!

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:01.250
That isn't true!

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.500
Then why did you?

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.020
Because...

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:06.720
Well...

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:07.980
It's complicated.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.690
Just be quiet.

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:17.160
Was it wise to tell her you'd
bring the proof tomorrow?

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:20.240
I couldn't exactly back down.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:25.250
I disposed of my dark
history very thoroughly.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.820
There is nothing left.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.670
The hand accessory isn't enough proof.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.130
Now what?

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:35.260
It's time for my last resort.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:39.460
Spirits, I order you.
Please honor my request.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.410
That's your last resort?!

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:43.520
I feel the power.

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:48.760
It will be fine. This locating method
has a 100% success rate.

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:52.020
As they say, fortune telling
can be unpredictable.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.070
Be quiet. You're distracting me.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:57.100
So, she found nothing.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.620
Is Nibutani really the imposter

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.730
as Dekomori claims?

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.540
No, not at all.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:09.860
But I don't really see the issue
no matter who's the real thing.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:20.960
Yuta.

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.170
Yeah.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:35.400
So, you have no proof then?

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:38.600
You could say that. But I am the real one.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:41.840
This is what you get for competing
with the real thing, Fake Summer!

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.770
You don't know the sheer scope of your folly!

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:50.190
Oh, be quiet! I will also add that
I'll bet you don't have any proof either.

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:54.840
You are truly appalling. The proof that
I am indeed Mori Summer...

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.120
...is I, in-of-myself!

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:58.470
Pardon?

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:01.670
I am the very visage of the magician
embodied within the Mabinogion.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:05.980
My true identity is obvious to one
with magical power such as Sanja.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.230
That's right!

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:11.270
I knew it was her the moment I saw her!

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:14.260
I knew this was truly the real Mori Summer!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:18.260
Do you recall how you claimed
that I was the real thing too?

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:20.400
Don't act so conceited!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.890
That was an advanced tactic
designed to throw you off guard!

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.200
So that's what it was!

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.310
Don't fall for that.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.190
I will be blunt.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:32.780
We are all now fully aware
that you are an imposter.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:37.840
No one with such a disgraceful countenance
could possibly be Mori Summer.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:42.660
Now, repent the error of your ways
and part with Sanja.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:48.690
That shut you up good.
I knew you were the imposter.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.690
Fine.

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:49.250
Huh?

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:53.350
So what if my old, dark history
was dragged out into the light?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:55.600
I just have to ignore
it, and it will go away.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:09:00.170
I no longer have any proof
that I'm Mori Summer.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:04.010
I'm relieved to finally be free of you.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:04.890
So long.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.810
Mori Summer?

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.330
Hey, Nibutani.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.010
F-Fake Summer?

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:19.460
Now she and I are both finally free
to take our proper paths uninhibited.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.290
Mistress Mori Summer.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.170
I'm relieved to finally be free of you.

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:37.510
As if! I know you hate to lose.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.320
Sanae, what's wrong?

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:42.550
You don't look very happy today.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.850
I'm fine.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.040
You're sure?

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:52.070
SENDER: MISTRESS MORI SUMMER
TO: DEKOMORI

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:52.520
Come to my house after school and
we will read the Mabinogion together.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.710
Are you really okay with this?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.820
It has nothing to do with me.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.760
Of course it does. She's impersonating you!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.150
Whatever. I just won't let it bother me.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.470
Ow.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.340
Dekomori.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.680
Yesterday was a true work of blunder!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:16.300
Your fakeness was finally exposed
for what it really is...

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.780
...along with your foolishness!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:20.270
W-wait!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:20.980
Why?

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:24.030
Why do you sulk? Did it hurt
so much to be beaten by me?

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:27.350
To be exposed for the
imposter you really are?

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:28.780
Not really.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:32.560
Go on, class is starting.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:38.650
Well, hmph! This is what I get
for exercising tact.

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:40.910
Are you sure?

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:42.290
About what?

00:10:55.810 --> 00:10:58.520
And then Deko went home?

00:10:58.520 --> 00:10:59.190
Yes.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:03.010
That's no good. That's
where you have to shine.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.540
You are Ghelzonianses, aren't you?

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.590
Please don't memorize that, Senpai!

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:10.780
I did ask them both to come to the club room.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:15.110
Dekomori is useless to me now.
I must find a temporary servant.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:16.800
And then there's you!

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:20.370
Do you really think Deko will be okay?

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:23.120
Whoever that person is, she scares me.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.550
Why is that?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:28.270
Listen.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:29.580
Love?

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.820
Yeah. According to Kumin-senpai...

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:33.830
...that person looks at Dekomori amorously.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.130
Don't be ridiculous.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:39.020
I actually thought the same thing.

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:40.660
When I look back at it...

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.970
...she does look different
when she looks at Dekomori.

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:47.810
You really should tell her.

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:51.450
W-why? Assuming that's true,

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:54.650
if that's what that idiot truly wants,
then leave it that way.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:58.350
Hey, what's the point of
being stubborn about it?

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.320
Dekomori is only into her because
she believes she's Mori Summer.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.710
That is exactly what ticks me off.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:06.370
How could she be taken in
by that imposter so easily?

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.990
But is she really?

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:09.500
What?

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.220
I think Deko is only doing it
because somewhere deep down...

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:15.460
...she still wants you to
be the real Mori Summer.

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:20.580
She's too stupid to think
something that complex.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:23.060
What is it?

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:23.770
Ssh.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.220
What is she doing?

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.400
I bet that's a photo of Deko!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.330
Battle?

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:39.390
Yeah. You will challenge her to battle
in front of Dekomori.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:41.930
Defeat her, and prove
that you are Mori Summer.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.090
That is the best way to do it now
there's no more proof

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.410
that you are the real Mori Summer.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:48.830
Excuse me?!

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.220
You've done it before, remember?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.570
You must fully become
Mori Summer and fight her.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.160
That's how I earned Rikka's trust!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:57.840
Infatuated much?

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.020
No!

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:03.650
Even I get embarrassed!
But there's no time to think.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:07.090
He's right. You can't let her take
Deko away from you.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.070
W-why should I care?

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.810
Argh, this is too much trouble!

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:12.780
Go, Rikka!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:14.390
Understood.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.990
W-what?

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:16.730
You need a crash course!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:20.230
I will engrave you with the power
of Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:23.160
Be destroyed, real. Blow up, synapses.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.450
Vanishment, This World!

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:27.920
Huh?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:28.780
What's wrong?!

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:32.180
Vanishment, This World!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:35.300
I think I'm incompatible with this shrine.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.750
Incompatible? Get real!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.600
Now what do we do?

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:42.250
Rikka can't do it, and Deko isn't
around to help either.

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:43.770
Togashi?

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.480
I'm through with all that.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:48.510
We need the magical devil girl.

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.680
Who, Shichimiya? But you...

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.250
The magical devil girl told me.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:56.810
She said would remain
a magical devil girl forever.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:01.630
And the contract between
you and I is absolute.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:02.940
It will work.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.670
I summon thee!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:13.840
I am magical devil girl,
Sophia Ring SP Saturn VII!

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:15.830
I will smite the angel!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:17.970
Sorry for calling you out so late.

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:21.340
That's okay. You guys helped me out
on my school field trip.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.840
I'm really glad things seem
to be working out for you two.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.390
Huh?

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:30.720
So, you want me to give Mori Summer
a crash course in combat?

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:32.610
What? You're serious?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.560
Yes, please.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.570
Leave it to me. I was her partner...

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:41.060
...back when she called herself Mori Summer,
so I know her well.

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.570
Do you see the medicinal plants over there?

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.650
You always picked and ate them.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.370
What? S-stop!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.660
You would put a notch in
a tree and drink its sap.

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:51.220
Stop!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.200
And you would spend entire days
trying to talk with small birds.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.340
Embarrassing! Embarrassing!
Embarrassing! Embarrassing!

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.720
Discard all shame!

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:01.680
You are Mori Summer, the magician
who has lived for 1,200 years!

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.310
You are here to spread your message of love!

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:05.180
No!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:06.190
Is she okay?

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.550
We have to. Do it.

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:10.010
Okay, here it comes!

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.510
No!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:24.620
I knew she was genuinely an imposter.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.750
Although I knew that all along.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:33.770
MAILBOX
Now delete that web page
or I won't get you a souvenir.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:33.120
Now delete that web page
or I won't get you a souvenir.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.830
And what is that?

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.520
Mistress Mori Summer!

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:44.080
Y-you startled me.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:49.680
It seems as though your
heart is still tainted.

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:51.760
What? Mistress Mori Summer?

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.480
I will purify it for you.

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:58.180
I will embrace your entirety with my love.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:01.610
Mistress Mori Summer,
you're standing too close.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.130
Let me take care of it.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.440
Wha... What?

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.910
Stop it!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:08.110
Sanja!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.080
Your thingies here are as cute as a baby's.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:13.920
Stop! Stop it!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:16.830
Help me, Fake Summer!

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:18.670
That's far enough.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.600
I have lost my memory, however...

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:27.680
I have lived for 1,500 years.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:31.050
I am the greatest and
most real magician alive.

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:35.360
I gather together the threads of the story
with the spirits to guide me.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:37.390
My name...

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:39.320
...is Mori Summer.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:41.530
What?

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:43.570
Are you here again?

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:45.560
You, who call yourself Mori Summer.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:50.310
I propose that we settle who the real
Mori Summer is here and now.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.790
What are you talking about?

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.570
We have already discussed this.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:17:00.710
If that is so, use your love
to purify me and obliterate me

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:02.860
for now and all eternity.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:09.000
We will have a wizard's duel
on the horizon of permanence.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:12.160
Take flight, elves! Whisper
to me, soul spirits!

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:15.000
Spiritual Caricature!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.560
Get her, Nibutani!

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:23.990
I know.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:27.420
I've taken it too far to get embarrassed now.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:35.650
What is the meaning of this?
Do you want Sanja that badly?

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.210
Get real.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:41.330
I can't stand the idea of you using
the name of Mori Summer, that's all!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:45.560
I am the true one. Come to me, soul spirits!

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:48.880
Fairy spirits, lend me your strength!

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:56.730
Nothing embarrasses me
more than my dark history...

00:17:57.110 --> 00:18:00.850
...but Mori Summer is still my creation!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.600
Fake Summer.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:06.260
I will not allow her to be
used by a creep like you

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:07.770
for your own despicable ends!

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.940
She was my own twisted love...

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.860
I aimed at myself!

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:20.800
Yes!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.300
Critical hit.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.760
Got that? Good. Now get lost.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.890
What was that attack supposed to be?

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:36.760
Is that your so-called power as Mori Summer?

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:42.000
Sorry to disappoint you,
but I have exhaustively

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.760
studied the entire content of the Mabinogion.

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.620
I am the greater incarnation of Mori Summer.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.270
The girl is mine.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.530
She is my angel
I fought so hard to find.

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:56.670
I have been following her ever since
I first saw her in the city.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:59.030
I waited so long to approach her.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:01.700
You will never have her!

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:05.080
Mori Summer!

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:05.080
Nibutani!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:12.970
Apparently I have the greater power
of imagination, Miss Faker.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:17.750
It's time for you to disappear
for good this time.

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.470
Begone!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.780
You're tough. Just let go.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:48.510
I should mention that even
if you do get what you want...

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:51.620
...and get the moronic freshman for yourself,
you'll only live to regret it.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.640
What?!

00:19:53.060 --> 00:19:57.060
She's the worst. She
never does as she's told.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:20:00.630
She has no intention of
respecting her elders.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.000
She's spoiled, and violent, and annoying.

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:08.260
But she gets lonely, and she can be
such a coward, and she's a crybaby.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:11.980
And she makes these really cute smiles
when you least expect it.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:13.990
Fake Summer.

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:17.870
She's no angel.
She's more trouble than any devil.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.360
She's the best idiot ever.

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:22.960
Did you call her an idiot?

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:25.950
Do not defile my Sanja!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.110
Nibutani!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:30.030
Mjolnir Hammer!

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:32.710
Sanja, why?

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:37.460
She is definitely the imposter.
She is Fake Summer, however...

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:40.960
She is a genuine imposter,
fair and square! Unlike you!

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:41.900
What?

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:43.900
You are not Mori Summer either!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:47.140
The real Mistress Mori Summer
would never do this!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:47.680
What?

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:50.420
You are a wolf in sheep's clothing!

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:52.730
I, Dekomori, will vanquish you, Fake Summer!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:56.400
Ultimate End Of The Great Hammer...

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.250
...GX!

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:09.150
I loved you from the moment I saw you.

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:11.630
I thought you were angelic.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.600
I wanted to make you look my way.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.150
That's all.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.420
What's so great about someone like her?

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:21.890
"Someone like her?" Sanja is an angel.

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:25.790
A pure and innocent angel.
She has never loved or been with a man.

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:28.260
She has never held hands,
never mind kissed anyone.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:30.740
She actually has had her first kiss.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:31.450
What?

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:32.600
On Christmas.

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.350
Th-that wasn't...

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:37.330
You're kidding. But I...

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:40.430
But I thought she was the one.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:45.660
Victory!

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:48.110
You had no part in it.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:51.260
I'm so glad they seem to be back to normal.

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:53.870
By the way, that kiss was an accident.

00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:57.290
That goes without saying!
Why are you blushing?!

00:21:57.600 --> 00:22:01.380
I am not blushing!
You're the one turning red.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.240
I am not!

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:06.010
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:06.010
You are so unlovable!
